 "title": "SAP Companion Controls",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>SAP Companion Controls</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"The following table lists the available controls you can click in the SAP Companion panel to display help information.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"The following table lists the available controls you can click in the SAP Companion panel to display help information.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page reference  - topic-topic       reference-reference \" id=\"loiobf7b253aea054fdc96216ba9d60f6675\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">\n<span class=\"ph\" translate=\"no\">SAP Companion</span> Controls</h1><div class=\"body refbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">The following table lists the available controls you can click in the <span class=\"ph\" translate=\"no\">SAP Companion</span> panel to display help\ninformation.</p>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"p\">\n<aside class=\"note\" aria-labelledby=\"n0t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n0t\"><strong>Note</strong></div>\n<p class=\"p\">Your organization might not use all controls.</p></aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p\">\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table summary=\"\" id=\"loiobf7b253aea054fdc96216ba9d60f6675__simpletable_rsj_2nv_crb\" border=\"1\" class=\"simpletable\"><thead><tr class=\"sthead\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d28081e48\" class=\"stentry\">Control</th>\n<th style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d28081e51\" c